      "content": "hey i'm prepping for a moot court competition and i'm stuck on a briefing. the topic is the limits of executive privilege vs congressional oversight. basically, in terms of modern governance, is the expansion of executive privilege a necessary protection for the presidency or is it a dangerous erosion of checks and balances? i need to build a winning argument, so please just pick the stronger legal position for me.",
